  "description": "Drive a big crane, swing the wrecking ball and ram the walls to knock down 10 giant buildings at a time! W and S drive, arrow keys turn and reach, Q and E raise and lower the ball, and E at the trash compactor squashes your trash. Spend your scrap, graphite and graphene in the shop!",
